{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-fable-5-2", "id": "msg_011CguUZDGWgQG9YiMToUAue", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Logit scale and D offset are both flat around the current value — the readout is already matched to the decoder, so no gain there. Two useful realisations: (1) since I hold `x`, `h`, `g1`, `g2`, I can re-simulate everything from the inputs onward offline for free (and even emulate the mirrored/role-swapped views by transforming `x`); (2) spellF1 is very sensitive to boundary timing. Let me first measure boundary timing bias on matched possessions and how much is lost between IoU 0.3 and 0.7.\n\n```python\ndef boundary_stats(name, pred=None):\n    d = D[name]; y = d[\"y\"]; pred = d[\"pred\"] if pred is None else pred\n    gt = spells(y); pr = spells(pred)\n    mg, mp = match(gt, pr, thr=0.3)\n    n = len(y)\n    off = collections.defaultdict(list)\n    ious = []\n    for i, j in mg.items():\n        s, e, l = gt[i]; s2, e2, _ = pr[j]\n        ious.append((min(e, e2) - max(s, s2)) / (max(e, e2) - min(s, s2)))\n        if s > 0:\n            kind = \"start after D\" if y[s - 1] == 2 else \"start after turnover\"\n            off[kind].append((s2 - s) / 25)\n        if e < n:\n            kind = \"end into D\" if y[e] == 2 else \"end by turnover\"\n            off[kind].append((e2 - e) / 25)\n    ious = np.array(ious)\n    print(name, \"matched@0.3: %d of %d gt, %d pred | of those IoU>=.5: %d, >=.7: %d, >=.9: %d\" % (len(mg), len(gt), len(pr), (ious >= .5).sum(), (ious >= .7).sum(), (ious >= .9).sum()))\n    for k, v in sorted(off.items()):\n        v = np.array(v)\n        print(\"    %-22s n=%3d  mean %+5.2fs  median %+5.2fs  |err|>1s: %2d  late>1s: %2d early>1s: %2d   q10 %+5.2f q90 %+5.2f\" % (\n            k, len(v), v.mean(), np.median(v), (np.abs(v) > 1).sum(), (v > 1).sum(), (v < -1).sum(), np.quantile(v, .1), np.quantile(v, .9)))\n\nfor name in D:\n    boundary_stats(name)\n```"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 4, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2617, "cache_read_input_tokens": 40716, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 2617}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "session_id": "id-00000000", "timestamp": "2026-11-10T15:23:24.916Z", "request_id": "req_011CguUZCYN7Pit9dVGam7jw"}
